OL,3,GNEWSASharing dangerous driving videos
OL,4,Ais 'truly reprehensible', PM says
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe government has urged social media
OL,7,Fcompanies to remove posts celebrating
OL,8,Fdangerous driving, as Prime Minister
OL,9,FAndy Burnham branded sharing them
OL,10,F"truly reprehensible".
OL,12,FEarlier Defence Minister Luke Pollard
OL,13,Ftold BBC Breakfast on Monday that
OL,14,F"social media companies could take the
OL,15,Fcontent down easily and adjust their
OL,16,Falgorithms to stop it being
OL,17,Fdistributed".
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
